        "en": "Composer Prediction",
        "zh": "下一步指令建议"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Predicts your next instruction from the current conversation and shows it as the composer placeholder; Tab turns it into an editable draft. One extra small model call per completed turn.",
        "zh": "根据当前对话预测你的下一条指令，直接显示成输入框里的占位文字，按 Tab 采纳为可编辑的草稿。每轮会多一次很小的模型调用。"
      },
